        "urine_color": "Urine color reflects pigments and urine concentration. Hydration, foods, medicines and blood can affect it, so color is interpreted with symptoms and the other urine findings.",
        "urine_glucose": "Urine glucose detects sugar passing into urine. It can occur when blood glucose is high or because of kidney handling and certain medicines; it does not replace a blood glucose measurement.",
